1
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:08,920
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:35,200 --> 00:01:38,920
ADAPTED FROM <i>JIA JIN CHAI</i>, ORIGINAL NOVEL
BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

3
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:42,840
STARS SHINE UPON AUSPICIOUS CLOUDS

4
00:01:42,920 --> 00:01:46,720
Your Zhuyu Estate
had the finest scenery in the capital.

5
00:01:46,800 --> 00:01:48,760
But you tore it down to help the needy.

6
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:52,560
My garden is nothing special,
yet you're praising it to the skies.

7
00:01:54,760 --> 00:01:56,320
How strange.

8
00:01:57,080 --> 00:01:58,600
I begged you to stay
at yesterday's banquet,

9
00:01:58,680 --> 00:02:00,360
but you wouldn't hear of it.

10
00:02:00,440 --> 00:02:02,280
Now you want a tour of the garden?

11
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:07,080
Can this compare to the natural beauty of
your Mount Yaowang?

12
00:02:08,199 --> 00:02:11,480
Who wants to drink
with a bunch of obnoxious men?

13
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:13,760
They're fat, bloated, and hard to look at.

14
00:02:13,840 --> 00:02:14,680
So vulgar.

15
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:18,360
Only the most favored officials
get invited

16
00:02:18,440 --> 00:02:20,040
to the Crown Prince's Residence.

17
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:25,360
And you, my dear sister,
have won the Crown Prince's favor.

18
00:02:27,200 --> 00:02:29,480
Half the world is dying of envy.
And you're still not content?

19
00:02:31,360 --> 00:02:33,000
Enough about that.

20
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:37,160
I heard the Crown Prince brought
rare stones from the south for his garden.

21
00:02:38,360 --> 00:02:40,440
Every turn reveals something beautiful.

22
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:43,440
Your Highness, show me around some more.

23
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:44,880
I want to see it all.

24
00:02:47,880 --> 00:02:50,920
All right, all right.
You always get your way.

25
00:02:53,040 --> 00:02:54,120
Watch your step, Rao.

26
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:58,600
Look.

27
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:33,480
NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED DURING FILMING

28
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:34,720
FILMED UNDER PROFESSIONAL SUPERVISION
WITHOUT HARM

29
00:03:42,440 --> 00:03:44,320
- The Crown Prince hit the target!
- Bravo!

30
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:46,280
- Your Highness is mighty!
- Indeed!

31
00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:48,000
- Your Highness is mighty!
- Excellent shot.

32
00:03:48,080 --> 00:03:49,880
The Crown Prince is in fine form today.

33
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:51,640
We've barely entered the woods,
and he's already made a kill.

34
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:54,280
Everyone knows
you're a master archer, Lord Lu.

35
00:03:55,160 --> 00:03:57,000
I'm showing off before an expert.

36
00:03:57,080 --> 00:03:58,320
How embarrassing.

37
00:03:58,400 --> 00:04:00,760
Your Highness is so busy with
state affairs, you rarely get to hunt.

38
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:02,680
Otherwise, the rest of us
would never get a chance to shine.

39
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:05,120
Lord Lu, you've always been so aloof.

40
00:04:05,640 --> 00:04:07,440
Whenever we brothers
invite you to a banquet,

41
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:09,320
you make every excuse not to come.

42
00:04:09,920 --> 00:04:12,280
So you do know
how to flatter my imperial brother.

43
00:04:13,640 --> 00:04:16,200
I meant every word. How is that flattery?

44
00:04:17,360 --> 00:04:20,560
Your Highness, I hear
a great white tiger roams these woods.

45
00:04:21,360 --> 00:04:23,960
If you capture it alive
and present it to His Majesty,

46
00:04:24,040 --> 00:04:25,000
he'll be delighted.

47
00:04:25,080 --> 00:04:26,280
Really? A great white tiger?

48
00:04:27,640 --> 00:04:30,920
Hunters say it's often spotted
roaming the ridge ahead.

49
00:04:32,120 --> 00:04:32,960
I'll lead the way, Your Highness.

50
00:04:33,720 --> 00:04:34,920
Quick! Lead us there!

51
00:04:36,880 --> 00:04:38,760
I thought the Lu family
was above all this.

52
00:04:38,840 --> 00:04:41,320
But the moment
my brother became Crown Prince,

53
00:04:41,400 --> 00:04:43,160
they couldn't wait to cozy up to him.

54
00:04:43,760 --> 00:04:44,640
Come on.

55
00:04:45,240 --> 00:04:47,960
Let's capture that white tiger first.
That'll be a great achievement.

56
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:50,120
Brothers, wait for me!

57
00:04:55,480 --> 00:04:57,440
SPRING'S EMBRACE

58
00:04:57,520 --> 00:04:58,480
Anything unusual?

59
00:04:58,560 --> 00:04:59,920
- Everything's normal.
- Good.

60
00:05:05,280 --> 00:05:07,120
The Crown Prince
thinks very highly of you, Shu.

61
00:05:08,280 --> 00:05:10,200
When he acts inappropriately,

62
00:05:10,720 --> 00:05:13,680
you should try to set him straight.

63
00:05:13,760 --> 00:05:14,760
Set him straight?

64
00:05:16,520 --> 00:05:18,120
He holds the royal power.

65
00:05:18,200 --> 00:05:20,040
Who am I to tell him no?

66
00:05:20,640 --> 00:05:24,040
Sometimes, Rao,
your innocence is almost adorable.

67
00:05:30,840 --> 00:05:32,680
SPRING'S EMBRACE

68
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:43,880
What's inside that courtyard?

69
00:05:44,640 --> 00:05:47,440
Just a storeroom. Nothing worth seeing.

70
00:05:48,120 --> 00:05:50,040
Let's go feed
the golden carp in the eastern lake.

71
00:05:51,640 --> 00:05:53,880
You must be hiding
something precious in there.

72
00:05:54,400 --> 00:05:57,320
If Your Highness won't let me see it,
that only makes me more curious.

73
00:06:19,760 --> 00:06:22,320
It seems the Lady of Wu'an

74
00:06:24,200 --> 00:06:25,360
didn't come for a tour today.

75
00:06:26,640 --> 00:06:29,000
My younger sister, Hongxian,
was abducted for no reason.

76
00:06:29,520 --> 00:06:31,240
Someone saw
she's in the Crown Prince's Residence.

77
00:06:32,320 --> 00:06:34,160
Hongxian is just a naive country girl.

78
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:36,960
Please, Your Highness,
show her mercy and let her go home.

79
00:06:38,080 --> 00:06:40,720
I'll owe you a favor,
and I'll repay it someday.

80
00:06:46,680 --> 00:06:48,880
Who gave you permission
to mistreat our guest?

81
00:06:48,960 --> 00:06:50,000
Leave us.

82
00:06:55,840 --> 00:06:58,840
There's someone
I'd like you to meet, dear sister.

83
00:07:10,520 --> 00:07:11,680
Greetings, Your Ladyship.

84
00:07:23,840 --> 00:07:26,360
Your Ladyship, do you remember this man?

85
00:07:27,560 --> 00:07:29,720
He's Jin Chang,
the head stewardess of my Wei family.

86
00:07:31,120 --> 00:07:32,680
He's also the man
who got you out of prison.

87
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:40,040
Leave us.
I'd like a word alone with Her Ladyship.

88
00:07:52,720 --> 00:07:55,960
Forced to kill someone.
Thrown into prison.

89
00:08:04,400 --> 00:08:07,600
<i>Tortured so brutally</i>
<i>that death seemed kinder.</i>

90
00:08:07,680 --> 00:08:09,000
<i>Just to stay alive,</i>

91
00:08:09,080 --> 00:08:12,320
<i>you had to grovel before</i>
<i>the vilest guards and prisoners.</i>

92
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:15,200
<i>- How humiliating that must have been.</i>
- Have some water.

93
00:08:15,280 --> 00:08:16,280
Drink it!

94
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:18,520
<i>In a place like that,</i>

95
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:21,640
- Drink!
<i>- a woman on death row…</i>

96
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:23,480
<i>- Just trying to survive…</i>
- Good!

97
00:08:23,560 --> 00:08:26,160
<i>- How much humiliation must she endure?</i>
- Drink!

98
00:08:27,040 --> 00:08:28,760
I can only imagine.

99
00:08:30,480 --> 00:08:31,520
But

100
00:08:33,159 --> 00:08:34,600
would Lord Lu understand?

101
00:08:35,400 --> 00:08:37,960
What about those refugees who worship you?

102
00:08:38,039 --> 00:08:40,799
Could they accept that
the noble, untouchable Lady of Wu'an

103
00:08:40,880 --> 00:08:43,679
was once a lowly death-row inmate?

104
00:08:46,040 --> 00:08:47,000
Rao,

105
00:08:47,920 --> 00:08:49,080
rumors can destroy a person.

106
00:08:49,680 --> 00:08:51,960
- Are you threatening me?
- I'm giving you a friendly warning.

107
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:56,640
Rao,

108
00:08:57,160 --> 00:08:59,680
every step you've taken
has been dangerous.

109
00:08:59,760 --> 00:09:01,640
You fought so hard to get where you are.

110
00:09:02,240 --> 00:09:05,360
Now you have a title and your own lands,
not to mention everyone's respect.

111
00:09:07,120 --> 00:09:09,040
Why can't you appreciate what you have?

112
00:09:09,640 --> 00:09:11,360
Why did you have to stick your nose in?

113
00:09:19,200 --> 00:09:20,400
Hongxian is my adoptive mother's daughter.

114
00:09:21,840 --> 00:09:24,480
<i>Rao! That's my sister's voice!</i>

115
00:09:24,560 --> 00:09:26,040
I can stay out of everything else.

116
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:29,360
Just give her back to me, please.

117
00:09:34,360 --> 00:09:35,400
<i>Rao!</i>

118
00:09:35,480 --> 00:09:40,040
<i>Save me! Don't leave me! Rao! Rao!</i>

119
00:09:41,240 --> 00:09:42,240
Are you begging me?

120
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:48,600
Yes.

121
00:09:52,400 --> 00:09:53,400
I'm begging you.

122
00:09:53,480 --> 00:09:55,880
Wei Rao,
you were born into the Wei family.

123
00:09:55,960 --> 00:09:57,640
Noble blood runs through your veins.

124
00:09:57,720 --> 00:09:59,480
How could you have
a sister from the slums?

125
00:10:00,320 --> 00:10:01,680
Someone so lowly…

126
00:10:01,760 --> 00:10:03,080
- has nothing to do with you!
- But…

127
00:10:03,160 --> 00:10:05,000
Don't you understand?

128
00:10:05,560 --> 00:10:07,400
Who would claim kinship
with a servant's child?

129
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:10,400
If you want to be true nobility,

130
00:10:10,480 --> 00:10:14,480
you must cut ties
with those filthy, lowborn people.

131
00:10:20,960 --> 00:10:22,240
Have you given up yet?

132
00:10:22,840 --> 00:10:25,920
Be good and do as you're told. Let's go.

133
00:10:30,200 --> 00:10:31,280
Stop!

134
00:10:32,360 --> 00:10:33,520
<i>Rao!</i>

135
00:10:35,080 --> 00:10:37,960
<i>Rao! Rao!</i>

136
00:10:39,040 --> 00:10:40,640
Come here, you!

137
00:10:45,600 --> 00:10:47,360
SPRING'S EMBRACE

138
00:10:51,720 --> 00:10:53,400
- Hongxian!
- Wei Rao,

139
00:10:53,480 --> 00:10:54,800
this is the Crown Prince's Residence!

140
00:10:54,880 --> 00:10:56,400
You can't just barge in!

141
00:11:04,640 --> 00:11:07,200
Rao, go home.

142
00:11:08,200 --> 00:11:10,600
Bury your past forever.

143
00:11:10,680 --> 00:11:15,000
Stay away from those lowborn people.
You're only lowering yourself.

144
00:11:24,480 --> 00:11:25,400
Come here.

145
00:11:30,720 --> 00:11:34,760
‪SPRING'S EMBRACE

146
00:12:03,600 --> 00:12:05,680
Learn from the Lady of Wu'an.

147
00:12:06,240 --> 00:12:07,720
She knows when to give in.

148
00:12:20,080 --> 00:12:21,880
I'm trying to save Wei Rao.

149
00:12:22,960 --> 00:12:24,240
And I'm trying to save you, too.

150
00:12:25,360 --> 00:12:26,680
If you keep being stubborn,

151
00:12:27,280 --> 00:12:29,160
you'll end up joining the dead.

152
00:12:35,160 --> 00:12:36,960
Clean her up.

153
00:12:37,040 --> 00:12:38,480
Then send her to serve His Highness.

154
00:12:39,480 --> 00:12:40,400
Yes, Your Highness.

155
00:12:57,440 --> 00:12:58,640
Get up!

156
00:13:05,560 --> 00:13:07,640
My Lord,
this courtyard's been abandoned for years.

157
00:13:07,720 --> 00:13:09,600
No one's lived here.
Why would Her Ladyship come here?

158
00:13:12,480 --> 00:13:13,320
Wait outside.

159
00:13:14,800 --> 00:13:15,640
Yes, My Lord.

160
00:13:40,840 --> 00:13:42,000
Wei Rao.

161
00:13:42,800 --> 00:13:46,440
She could've done me a simple favor
and given Hongxian back.

162
00:13:48,840 --> 00:13:50,080
But she didn't.

163
00:13:51,560 --> 00:13:53,760
Even with my title as Lady of Wu'an,

164
00:13:55,080 --> 00:13:57,200
those royal nobles still see me

165
00:13:58,800 --> 00:14:00,600
as beneath them.

166
00:14:10,240 --> 00:14:11,640
They look down on me.

167
00:14:12,920 --> 00:14:14,680
Deep down, they despise me.

168
00:14:18,760 --> 00:14:20,080
- Wei Rao.
- Tell me…

169
00:14:25,240 --> 00:14:27,760
Why did fate bring me

170
00:14:30,280 --> 00:14:31,680
to a place like this?

171
00:14:33,120 --> 00:14:34,960
The rich feast on the finest grains,

172
00:14:35,840 --> 00:14:37,760
while the poor survive
on scraps and husks.

173
00:14:38,560 --> 00:14:40,720
My stomach isn't like theirs.

174
00:14:42,320 --> 00:14:44,640
I can't stomach their rich food and wine.

175
00:14:45,920 --> 00:14:48,040
My eyes aren't like theirs, either.

176
00:14:48,800 --> 00:14:50,760
When I see dancers
entertaining the nobles,

177
00:14:52,440 --> 00:14:55,480
all I can think about is
how little their families sold them for,

178
00:14:56,080 --> 00:14:58,360
and whether
their children are going hungry.

179
00:15:02,360 --> 00:15:03,520
And my hands…

180
00:15:07,080 --> 00:15:07,920
Look.

181
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:16,080
Feel them.

182
00:15:16,160 --> 00:15:18,840
My hands aren't like theirs, either.
They're different.

183
00:15:19,760 --> 00:15:21,120
No matter
how many expensive treatments I use,

184
00:15:21,720 --> 00:15:23,200
they're still rough.

185
00:15:25,600 --> 00:15:26,840
Why?

186
00:15:29,240 --> 00:15:31,120
Why did fate make me this way?

187
00:15:33,080 --> 00:15:35,600
I'm neither a commoner nor a noble.

188
00:15:36,160 --> 00:15:38,800
When I sit among them, I never fit in!

189
00:15:38,880 --> 00:15:41,120
They call me crazy! They call me a fool!

190
00:15:41,640 --> 00:15:44,280
But I could've lived just
as comfortably and carefree as they do.

191
00:15:44,360 --> 00:15:47,160
Why can't I? Why?

192
00:15:48,720 --> 00:15:52,280
Why can't I? Why can't I?!

193
00:16:02,000 --> 00:16:03,040
You're different.

194
00:16:05,600 --> 00:16:06,920
Then be different.

195
00:16:11,800 --> 00:16:14,240
Now, come with me.

196
00:17:35,960 --> 00:17:37,040
Do you see?

197
00:17:40,280 --> 00:17:41,400
That was me.

198
00:17:43,840 --> 00:17:45,040
I was her.

199
00:17:46,080 --> 00:17:47,240
All of this…

200
00:17:48,600 --> 00:17:49,480
I already know.

201
00:17:49,560 --> 00:17:51,640
But you've never seen it
with your own eyes.

202
00:17:53,400 --> 00:17:55,240
If I were still dumping chamber pots,

203
00:17:55,320 --> 00:17:57,440
and you rode past on horseback,

204
00:17:59,120 --> 00:18:01,240
would you even spare me a glance?

205
00:18:04,040 --> 00:18:05,200
You wouldn't.

206
00:18:06,840 --> 00:18:08,120
Neither would Qi Zhongkai.

207
00:18:11,040 --> 00:18:13,040
Even the stray dogs

208
00:18:14,120 --> 00:18:15,760
would run away from me.

209
00:18:20,600 --> 00:18:22,400
Who could ever love that version of me?

210
00:18:23,880 --> 00:18:25,880
What if I were just an ordinary,

211
00:18:25,960 --> 00:18:28,600
ugly, boring man?

212
00:18:29,560 --> 00:18:31,160
Not the heir to a duke's estate.

213
00:18:32,880 --> 00:18:34,040
Not the man you see before you.

214
00:18:35,200 --> 00:18:36,680
Would you still marry me?

215
00:18:45,400 --> 00:18:47,080
When we first met,

216
00:18:48,520 --> 00:18:50,240
I was the heir to the Duke of Ying.

217
00:18:50,880 --> 00:18:52,680
And you were the substitute bride.

218
00:18:53,360 --> 00:18:55,840
I can't go back and give you an answer.

219
00:18:56,760 --> 00:18:58,280
The woman I see

220
00:18:59,800 --> 00:19:03,480
is the one standing here,
right in front of me.

221
00:19:05,880 --> 00:19:07,520
Your past may have been painful.

222
00:19:07,600 --> 00:19:09,920
Then let it be painful.So what?

223
00:19:11,840 --> 00:19:13,480
I should be thanking her.

224
00:19:16,920 --> 00:19:17,760
For what?

225
00:19:18,680 --> 00:19:20,960
For her strength. For never giving up.

226
00:19:21,480 --> 00:19:23,400
For her ambition.
For never once bowing her head.

227
00:19:25,360 --> 00:19:27,840
Step by step,

228
00:19:30,320 --> 00:19:32,120
she made her way to me.

229
00:19:34,400 --> 00:19:35,960
That girl named A-Chou…

230
00:19:38,680 --> 00:19:40,280
How remarkable she must have been.

231
00:20:02,480 --> 00:20:03,840
But Lu Zhuo…

232
00:20:05,320 --> 00:20:06,720
I don't know what to do anymore.

233
00:20:07,480 --> 00:20:09,840
They're pressuring me. They won't stop.

234
00:20:10,880 --> 00:20:11,760
Who?

235
00:20:12,880 --> 00:20:14,080
Who's threatening you?

236
00:20:15,160 --> 00:20:17,040
My shameful past…

237
00:20:17,920 --> 00:20:20,200
I don't want anyone to know.

238
00:20:20,280 --> 00:20:22,320
I can't bear those judgmental looks again.

239
00:20:22,400 --> 00:20:23,360
But the Crown Prince…

240
00:20:24,640 --> 00:20:27,000
He's gotten hold of Jin Chang,
the Wei family's steward.

241
00:20:27,880 --> 00:20:29,840
He's the one who got me out of prison.

242
00:20:30,920 --> 00:20:33,160
He knows every humiliating, awful thing
I went through.

243
00:20:34,840 --> 00:20:36,280
I can't take it anymore.

244
00:20:37,520 --> 00:20:38,680
Please help me.

245
00:20:39,480 --> 00:20:41,040
Help me get rid of this threat, please.

246
00:20:42,320 --> 00:20:43,160
Where is he?

247
00:20:46,400 --> 00:20:47,880
The Crown Prince has a private prison

248
00:20:48,800 --> 00:20:50,320
on the east side of the city.

249
00:20:51,800 --> 00:20:53,160
Jin Chang is being held there.

250
00:20:54,040 --> 00:20:55,400
If he gets out and starts talking…

251
00:20:55,480 --> 00:20:56,560
- Then I'll…
- He won't.

252
00:20:58,840 --> 00:21:00,320
You'll never see him again.

253
00:21:02,760 --> 00:21:03,880
I promise.

254
00:21:06,680 --> 00:21:07,520
Really?

255
00:21:22,480 --> 00:21:23,400
Here.

256
00:21:23,480 --> 00:21:24,840
They call it
the Crown Prince's private prison,

257
00:21:24,920 --> 00:21:26,280
but it's really just a separate estate.

258
00:21:26,800 --> 00:21:29,720
Our scouts say he keeps
thieves and runaway servants there,

259
00:21:29,800 --> 00:21:30,960
caught during his patrols.

260
00:21:31,840 --> 00:21:32,960
That's all.

261
00:21:34,320 --> 00:21:36,680
The Crown Prince is known
for his kindness and humility.

262
00:21:37,280 --> 00:21:40,040
He has an excellent reputation at court.
But he's still royalty.

263
00:21:40,120 --> 00:21:41,840
Who knows
what he's really like in private?

264
00:21:41,920 --> 00:21:45,240
Are those prisoners
truly criminals or innocent people?

265
00:21:45,320 --> 00:21:47,240
Who would dare question him?

266
00:21:48,400 --> 00:21:51,080
The man you're looking for…
Is he really inside that estate?

267
00:21:55,800 --> 00:22:00,880
NOBLE AND BRIGHT

268
00:22:01,600 --> 00:22:02,680
Maybe.

269
00:22:03,200 --> 00:22:05,120
You never make a move unless you're sure.

270
00:22:05,720 --> 00:22:07,680
Why are you being so evasive?

271
00:22:07,760 --> 00:22:08,600
Is something wrong?

272
00:22:09,480 --> 00:22:10,720
Stop asking so many questions.

273
00:22:11,920 --> 00:22:13,040
You'll find out soon enough.

274
00:22:14,880 --> 00:22:17,600
Don't you think Wei Rao has changed a lot?

275
00:22:20,800 --> 00:22:21,800
I trust her.

276
00:22:23,840 --> 00:22:26,200
- Why are we here?
- No idea.

277
00:22:26,280 --> 00:22:28,800
- Do you know what is it about?
- Let's hear it.

278
00:22:29,960 --> 00:22:31,920
So many people train here,

279
00:22:32,840 --> 00:22:34,680
but I chose only you.

280
00:22:35,480 --> 00:22:36,480
Do you know why?

281
00:22:36,560 --> 00:22:38,280
No idea.

282
00:22:38,360 --> 00:22:39,400
All of you

283
00:22:40,120 --> 00:22:43,000
fled here from the northwestern frontier.

284
00:22:44,080 --> 00:22:45,680
You're fighters by nature.

285
00:22:46,280 --> 00:22:47,200
Some of you

286
00:22:48,240 --> 00:22:49,560
were attacked by raiders,

287
00:22:50,200 --> 00:22:52,400
fought them to the death,

288
00:22:52,480 --> 00:22:53,960
and fled after your homes
were burned down.

289
00:22:54,640 --> 00:22:55,680
Others

290
00:22:57,080 --> 00:22:59,720
had their land stolen
by powerful landlords,

291
00:23:01,320 --> 00:23:04,800
killed their enemies, and had to flee.

292
00:23:06,200 --> 00:23:07,040
Aman.

293
00:23:13,120 --> 00:23:14,520
That's a lot of money!

294
00:23:15,840 --> 00:23:17,400
His Majesty has issued a secret decree.

295
00:23:18,080 --> 00:23:19,480
He needs you to carry it out.

296
00:23:20,440 --> 00:23:23,640
Succeed,
and you'll all be richly rewarded.

297
00:23:24,960 --> 00:23:26,240
All that money?

298
00:23:26,840 --> 00:23:28,040
- Really? That good?
- But if you fail,

299
00:23:28,680 --> 00:23:30,800
you'll lose your heads.

300
00:23:35,320 --> 00:23:36,280
Get lost!

301
00:23:37,600 --> 00:23:40,280
Your Ladyship,
I crawled out of a pile of corpses.

302
00:23:40,920 --> 00:23:42,320
I was once so hungry I couldn't walk.

303
00:23:42,400 --> 00:23:43,920
I could even cut flesh
from my own thigh for food.

304
00:23:44,000 --> 00:23:45,080
Not one of
those rich officials in the capital

305
00:23:45,160 --> 00:23:46,840
ever gave me so much as a sip of water.

306
00:23:47,640 --> 00:23:49,600
You were the one who saved my life.

307
00:23:50,680 --> 00:23:52,920
We don't answer to any emperor.
We answer only to you.

308
00:23:53,520 --> 00:23:54,920
Whatever you say, we'll do it.

309
00:23:55,000 --> 00:23:56,120
- That's right!
- Yes, Your Ladyship!

310
00:23:56,200 --> 00:23:57,080
- We follow you!
- Your orders are ours!

311
00:23:57,160 --> 00:23:58,840
- We're with you, Your Ladyship!
- Your Ladyship!

312
00:23:58,920 --> 00:23:59,960
We follow you!

313
00:24:00,600 --> 00:24:01,440
What's your name?

314
00:24:02,040 --> 00:24:04,160
I don't have one. They call me Xiao.

315
00:24:05,120 --> 00:24:07,560
Your Ladyship,
let me bring a few more men.

316
00:24:07,640 --> 00:24:09,560
They are the same as me.
We lost everything,

317
00:24:10,280 --> 00:24:11,560
killed the governor's
entire family, and fled.

318
00:24:12,880 --> 00:24:14,200
Each of them can take on ten men.

319
00:24:14,280 --> 00:24:16,480
- They're all fierce fighters.
- Good!

320
00:24:17,120 --> 00:24:19,520
Xiao, I'll remember you.

321
00:24:21,920 --> 00:24:23,600
Listen up, everyone!

322
00:24:24,320 --> 00:24:27,040
Under my command,
you'll be rewarded for your achievements.

323
00:24:27,840 --> 00:24:31,000
The more you accomplish,
the greater your reward!

324
00:24:32,000 --> 00:24:33,760
And if any of you are captured alive…

325
00:24:33,840 --> 00:24:35,480
They'll only take us dead.

326
00:24:37,920 --> 00:24:39,560
If anyone dares betray our benefactor,

327
00:24:40,080 --> 00:24:42,120
I'll carve them up alive, piece by piece!

328
00:24:45,720 --> 00:24:48,040
We obey your orders, Your Ladyship!

329
00:25:05,200 --> 00:25:06,840
Will you report this to Lady Li?

330
00:25:07,560 --> 00:25:08,760
Because if you do,

331
00:25:11,000 --> 00:25:12,120
you'll be betraying me.

332
00:25:16,280 --> 00:25:18,440
When I left the palace, Lady Li told me

333
00:25:19,240 --> 00:25:20,800
that my life is tied to yours.

334
00:25:20,880 --> 00:25:23,760
I answer only to you now,
not to anyone in the palace.

335
00:25:43,640 --> 00:25:46,360
ZHUYU ESTATE

336
00:26:00,120 --> 00:26:02,200
Your Ladyship, it's past the Xu hour.

337
00:26:06,640 --> 00:26:07,600
There's no rush.

338
00:26:14,160 --> 00:26:16,720
It's almost the Hai hour.
When are we making our move?

339
00:26:18,280 --> 00:26:19,160
Wei Rao isn't here yet.

340
00:26:19,760 --> 00:26:21,480
She's a pampered noblewoman.

341
00:26:21,560 --> 00:26:23,320
Why wait for her when
there's fighting to be done?

342
00:26:24,240 --> 00:26:25,320
Why don't we make it a contest?

343
00:26:25,400 --> 00:26:26,880
First one to find Jin Chang wins.

344
00:26:28,000 --> 00:26:30,040
- I'm worried…
- You're getting soft.

345
00:26:30,120 --> 00:26:32,440
It's just a small operation,
and you're already having second thoughts?

346
00:26:35,000 --> 00:26:37,640
- I'm worried she won't show up at all.
- Why are you being so secretive?

347
00:26:37,720 --> 00:26:39,240
Can't you just spit it out?

348
00:26:39,760 --> 00:26:42,240
Enough with the riddles.
You're getting on my nerves.

349
00:26:50,200 --> 00:26:51,080
Her Ladyship left
the estate with some men.

350
00:26:51,160 --> 00:26:53,160
She shook off everyone tailing her.
We don't know where she went.

351
00:26:54,400 --> 00:26:55,240
I knew it.

352
00:26:56,960 --> 00:26:59,000
Qi Zhongkai. Move in. Now.

353
00:27:01,960 --> 00:27:03,000
Move!

354
00:27:19,880 --> 00:27:22,040
- Your Highness!
- Your Highness!

355
00:27:22,120 --> 00:27:24,000
- Over here!
- Your Highness, come here!

356
00:27:24,080 --> 00:27:25,040
Your Highness!

357
00:27:32,840 --> 00:27:33,800
- Hurry!
- Hurry!

358
00:27:41,560 --> 00:27:43,720
Talk. Where are the prisoners?

359
00:27:48,920 --> 00:27:50,720
My Lord,
looks like everything's going smoothly.

360
00:27:52,040 --> 00:27:52,960
Let's go.

361
00:27:57,160 --> 00:27:58,520
Your Highness!

362
00:27:59,920 --> 00:28:01,280
What are you doing here?

363
00:28:01,360 --> 00:28:04,320
Your Highness, there's trouble.
The estate on the east side is on fire.

364
00:28:04,400 --> 00:28:06,400
Intruders slipped in during the chaos.

365
00:28:08,240 --> 00:28:09,120
Everyone, out.

366
00:28:11,520 --> 00:28:13,200
They let all the prisoners escape.

367
00:28:13,280 --> 00:28:15,320
Earlier, some foolish clerk
at the Court of Justice

368
00:28:15,400 --> 00:28:17,040
accepted a petition
from those troublemakers,

369
00:28:17,120 --> 00:28:18,920
claiming young women
vanished without cause

370
00:28:19,000 --> 00:28:20,400
The Commandant of Justice
had those rebels arrested

371
00:28:20,480 --> 00:28:21,920
and locked up at the estate.

372
00:28:22,000 --> 00:28:23,040
They hadn't been executed yet.

373
00:28:23,640 --> 00:28:25,320
Take half the men from the residence.

374
00:28:25,400 --> 00:28:26,800
- Go capture them immediately.
- Yes, Your Highness.

375
00:28:27,400 --> 00:28:31,360
And remember, keep it quiet.
Leave no survivors.

376
00:28:33,640 --> 00:28:35,160
Send word to the Northern Army, too.

377
00:28:36,360 --> 00:28:38,160
There'll be some unrest
in the city tonight.

378
00:28:39,000 --> 00:28:40,680
Tell them to stay out of it.

379
00:28:40,760 --> 00:28:42,320
- Go.
- Yes, Your Highness.

380
00:28:45,640 --> 00:28:46,520
Your Highness.

381
00:28:47,400 --> 00:28:48,960
Where's that girl I had my eye on?

382
00:28:50,160 --> 00:28:51,320
The one selling flatbread.

383
00:28:51,400 --> 00:28:53,400
Right, right! I'll see to it at once.

384
00:28:53,480 --> 00:28:55,120
- Quick! Go!
- I'll send her in.

385
00:29:00,960 --> 00:29:03,440
CROWN PRINCE'S RESIDENCE

386
00:29:12,320 --> 00:29:14,520
Didn't they just leave? Why are they back?

387
00:29:25,520 --> 00:29:28,200
Secure the main gate,
rear gate, and both side gates.

388
00:29:28,840 --> 00:29:30,400
No one gets in or out.

389
00:29:39,480 --> 00:29:41,240
<i>I scouted the place</i>
<i>thoroughly during the day.</i>

390
00:29:41,320 --> 00:29:43,000
<i>Only one narrow alley from the rear gate</i>
<i>leads to the inner courtyard.</i>

391
00:29:43,640 --> 00:29:45,920
<i>There's a guard every seven paces.</i>
<i>Security is tight.</i>

392
00:29:46,000 --> 00:29:48,440
This is a restricted area!
Who dares trespass?

393
00:30:08,640 --> 00:30:09,520
JINGXING PAVILLION

394
00:30:25,960 --> 00:30:27,000
Kill them! Kill them!

395
00:30:33,680 --> 00:30:35,360
I… I don't work for the Crown Prince…

396
00:30:35,440 --> 00:30:37,920
Please spare me! Have mercy…

397
00:31:21,160 --> 00:31:24,000
You think you can fight back?
Stop struggling.

398
00:31:24,080 --> 00:31:26,680
I'll have some fun with you.
You think you can…

399
00:31:32,400 --> 00:31:33,440
Who's there?

400
00:32:26,000 --> 00:32:26,840
Your Ladyship.

401
00:32:26,920 --> 00:32:28,800
What about the women
locked up in the back courtyard?

402
00:32:29,520 --> 00:32:30,360
Free them all.

403
00:32:56,600 --> 00:32:58,680
Don't be afraid. I'm here to rescue you.

404
00:33:00,560 --> 00:33:01,760
- Come on!
- Let's go!

405
00:33:01,840 --> 00:33:02,760
- Hurry!
- Move!

406
00:33:14,160 --> 00:33:15,240
Come.

407
00:33:19,400 --> 00:33:20,920
Someone will meet you
at the end of this alley.

408
00:33:21,520 --> 00:33:24,200
Whatever happens, don't look back.
Just keep running.

409
00:33:24,280 --> 00:33:26,960
- Thank you, sir!
- Thank you!

410
00:33:27,040 --> 00:33:27,880
Go, quickly!

411
00:33:28,480 --> 00:33:30,160
<i>Once the job is done, don't hesitate.</i>

412
00:33:30,680 --> 00:33:32,320
<i>Avoid Xiyin Street.</i>
<i>It's full of government offices.</i>

413
00:33:32,920 --> 00:33:36,000
<i>Hide in Jiuquan Alley,</i>
<i>Guangbu Ward, or Jingji Ward.</i>

414
00:33:36,080 --> 00:33:38,520
<i>Those areas are crowded</i>
<i>with refugees and full of winding streets.</i>

415
00:33:38,600 --> 00:33:40,160
<i>It'll be nearly impossible</i>
<i>to track you down.</i>

416
00:33:40,760 --> 00:33:41,640
Go!

417
00:33:44,960 --> 00:33:45,840
There are intruders
in the Crown Prince's Residence!

418
00:33:45,920 --> 00:33:48,320
Alert the Northern Army!
Catch those intruders!

419
00:33:49,240 --> 00:33:50,280
Let's go.

420
00:33:51,120 --> 00:33:52,000
‪Rao.

421
00:33:52,600 --> 00:33:54,200
Her Ladyship said to spread out.

422
00:33:54,280 --> 00:33:55,720
We can't waste any time.

423
00:34:22,679 --> 00:34:23,320
UPHOLD VIRTUE AND HONOR TRADITION

424
00:34:23,400 --> 00:34:24,960
Your Highness, forgive my late arrival.

425
00:34:25,560 --> 00:34:27,159
I heard His Highness was injured.
How is he?

426
00:34:28,120 --> 00:34:29,120
His Highness…

427
00:34:32,639 --> 00:34:33,800
How is His Highness?

428
00:34:33,880 --> 00:34:36,880
Your Highness,
His Highness was only shaken up.

429
00:34:36,960 --> 00:34:38,719
- He's not seriously hurt.
- I'll go see him.

430
00:34:39,840 --> 00:34:43,000
Your Highness, His Highness
has taken his medicine and gone to bed.

431
00:34:43,080 --> 00:34:44,320
He's ordered that no one disturb him.

432
00:34:45,040 --> 00:34:47,440
General Li. His Highness orders you
to search the entire city.

433
00:34:47,520 --> 00:34:49,360
You must capture
those intruders before dawn.

434
00:34:50,080 --> 00:34:50,920
Understood.

435
00:34:51,679 --> 00:34:54,600
It was her. It had to be her!

436
00:34:55,480 --> 00:34:57,160
Anyone bold enough
to storm the Crown Prince's Residence

437
00:34:57,240 --> 00:34:59,360
must be a ruthless criminal.

438
00:35:00,000 --> 00:35:01,040
How would Your Highness know such people?

439
00:35:02,800 --> 00:35:04,920
The leader has a wound on the chest.

440
00:35:05,000 --> 00:35:07,200
Take your men
and search every nearby residence.

441
00:35:07,280 --> 00:35:10,000
Question anyone suspicious,
regardless of rank.

442
00:35:10,080 --> 00:35:11,440
Let no one escape.

443
00:35:12,280 --> 00:35:14,400
- But…
- The Crown Prince is heir to the throne.

444
00:35:14,480 --> 00:35:16,640
An attack on his residence
threatens the throne itself

445
00:35:16,720 --> 00:35:18,000
and defies His Majesty's authority.

446
00:35:18,600 --> 00:35:21,600
I've ordered you to find those criminals.
Are you defying my orders?

447
00:35:22,440 --> 00:35:23,520
Yes, Your Highness.

448
00:35:24,280 --> 00:35:25,320
Move out!

449
00:35:29,960 --> 00:35:31,520
Hurry! Move.

450
00:35:36,680 --> 00:35:39,720
I thought His Highness was only shaken up.
What's going on?

451
00:35:39,800 --> 00:35:42,640
The imperial physicians are treating him.
Please don't worry, Your Highness.

452
00:35:50,560 --> 00:35:52,560
What kind of injury is so serious

453
00:35:53,360 --> 00:35:55,240
that even I, his own wife,

454
00:35:56,080 --> 00:35:57,600
can't be told?

455
00:35:58,560 --> 00:36:00,240
Hurry!

456
00:36:00,320 --> 00:36:01,360
Hurry! Hurry!

457
00:36:13,200 --> 00:36:15,280
Search every street thoroughly!

458
00:36:15,360 --> 00:36:17,080
Don't let anyone suspicious get away!

459
00:36:17,680 --> 00:36:19,200
You men in the back, keep up!

460
00:36:40,040 --> 00:36:41,040
You…

461
00:36:42,280 --> 00:36:43,840
What am I supposed to do with you?

462
00:36:54,600 --> 00:36:57,480
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

463
00:36:58,520 --> 00:37:00,360
General, this is the Duke's residence.
Are we searching it too?

464
00:37:01,840 --> 00:37:03,600
- Knock on the door.
- Move!

465
00:37:09,040 --> 00:37:10,240
‪Search under orders!

466
00:37:12,000 --> 00:37:12,840
You…

467
00:37:19,200 --> 00:37:22,040
SONGYUE HALL

468
00:37:27,800 --> 00:37:29,840
SHIZHAI

469
00:37:32,520 --> 00:37:34,560
Who dares barge into the Duke's Residence?

470
00:37:35,160 --> 00:37:37,960
At midnight tonight, intruders attacked
the Crown Prince's Residence.

471
00:37:38,040 --> 00:37:39,280
By order of the Crown Prince,

472
00:37:39,360 --> 00:37:41,480
I'm searching
the entire city for the culprits.

473
00:37:42,000 --> 00:37:43,280
Please inform Lord Lu of my arrival.

474
00:37:45,320 --> 00:37:46,520
Wait here.

475
00:37:49,680 --> 00:37:51,880
My Lord, the Northern Army is here.

476
00:37:51,960 --> 00:37:53,960
They say the Crown Prince's Residence
was attacked and want to search.

477
00:38:12,080 --> 00:38:13,080
How dare you!

478
00:38:18,440 --> 00:38:20,280
I'm Li Wei,
a captain in the Northern Army.

479
00:38:21,000 --> 00:38:22,440
I'm here to search
on the Crown Prince's orders.

480
00:38:23,200 --> 00:38:26,000
Lord Lu,
please come out and speak with me.

481
00:38:34,280 --> 00:38:35,120
I heard you.

482
00:38:36,440 --> 00:38:39,240
A handful of thieves
broke into the Crown Prince's Residence?

483
00:38:39,760 --> 00:38:41,880
You men are utterly incompetent.

484
00:38:42,600 --> 00:38:45,040
What? And now
you want to search my residence?

485
00:38:46,040 --> 00:38:49,600
Do you think my men
are just as useless as yours?

486
00:38:51,920 --> 00:38:52,800
I wouldn't dare.

487
00:38:53,320 --> 00:38:54,600
I'm only following orders
to search the premises.

488
00:38:55,200 --> 00:38:57,680
The thieves may have slipped in disguised.
We're just taking precautions.

489
00:38:59,040 --> 00:39:01,360
I apologize for the intrusion.
Please forgive us, Lord Lu.

490
00:39:02,160 --> 00:39:04,160
Please allow us to conduct the search.

491
00:39:04,240 --> 00:39:05,520
Absolutely not.

492
00:39:06,480 --> 00:39:08,800
- Lord Lu.
- There's no one in my room.

493
00:39:09,480 --> 00:39:10,400
You may leave.

494
00:39:11,040 --> 00:39:14,240
I'm merely following orders.
If Lord Lu insists on stopping us,

495
00:39:14,840 --> 00:39:17,760
perhaps there's something inside
you don't want us to see.

496
00:39:18,920 --> 00:39:19,840
What's all that noise?

497
00:39:21,520 --> 00:39:22,360
Stop!

498
00:39:24,240 --> 00:39:25,520
Think carefully before you act.

499
00:39:26,360 --> 00:39:27,800
I'm afraid you don't have the nerve

500
00:39:29,000 --> 00:39:30,160
to face who's inside.

501
00:39:31,400 --> 00:39:34,320
Zhao Song, Zhao Bai. Keep an eye on him.

502
00:39:49,080 --> 00:39:52,200
The leader has a chest wound.
One look will confirm it.

503
00:39:56,640 --> 00:39:58,720
How dare you!
Who said you could come any closer?

504
00:39:59,800 --> 00:40:01,400
Get over there and kneel when you speak!

505
00:40:07,760 --> 00:40:10,000
Who do you think you are?
How dare you lift my bed curtains?

506
00:40:10,600 --> 00:40:12,120
Forgive me, Your Ladyship!
I didn't recognize you!

507
00:40:13,400 --> 00:40:14,440
Please calm down, Your Ladyship.

508
00:40:14,960 --> 00:40:17,240
You've got some nerve!
What exactly are you looking for?

509
00:40:17,840 --> 00:40:20,680
You want to inspect my body?
Go ahead, inspect me!

510
00:40:22,320 --> 00:40:24,000
You're hardly dressed properly.
Go back inside.

511
00:40:24,080 --> 00:40:26,560
I won't! Didn't he want to search my bed?

512
00:40:26,640 --> 00:40:29,360
Go on! There's a thief hiding in it!
Hurry up and search!

513
00:40:29,440 --> 00:40:32,520
Open those eyes of yours
and take a good, hard look!

514
00:40:32,600 --> 00:40:34,320
I didn't know Your Ladyship was here.
I was only…

515
00:40:34,400 --> 00:40:35,480
You're a captain in the Northern Army!

516
00:40:35,560 --> 00:40:38,120
Instead of catching thieves,
you sneak into women's private quarters

517
00:40:38,200 --> 00:40:39,440
and demand they undress for inspection?

518
00:40:40,040 --> 00:40:43,000
Have you no shame?
You shameless, filthy creep!

519
00:40:44,040 --> 00:40:45,400
Go on. Search!

520
00:40:46,000 --> 00:40:47,040
Find a thief,
and I'll see you're rewarded.

521
00:40:47,120 --> 00:40:49,440
Find nothing, and I'll charge you
with abusing your authority!

522
00:40:49,520 --> 00:40:51,520
I'll make sure
you lose your rank and your job!

523
00:40:52,200 --> 00:40:54,000
Had enough? Now get out!

524
00:40:57,400 --> 00:41:00,000
He's useless in battle,
but he sure knows how to bully women!

525
00:41:00,080 --> 00:41:02,720
And he claims he's hunting thieves!
Where are they?

526
00:41:02,800 --> 00:41:03,920
Who told you to let him leave?

527
00:41:04,000 --> 00:41:05,400
- You're no better than him!
- Enough.

528
00:41:05,480 --> 00:41:07,400
All right, that's enough.
It's freezing out here.

529
00:41:07,480 --> 00:41:08,400
- You'll catch a cold.
- Sheathe your swords!

530
00:41:09,040 --> 00:41:10,120
Report!

531
00:41:11,960 --> 00:41:14,000
General. We've searched
all the other courtyards.

532
00:41:14,080 --> 00:41:15,160
There's no sign of the intruders.

533
00:41:15,240 --> 00:41:16,600
You worthless scoundrel!

534
00:41:16,680 --> 00:41:18,560
Tomorrow, I'll send people
to the Marquis of Zhennan's estate

535
00:41:18,640 --> 00:41:19,840
to curse you out for a whole month!

536
00:41:19,920 --> 00:41:23,440
I'll make sure your entire family,
inside and out, is disgraced!

537
00:41:23,520 --> 00:41:24,560
Let's go!

538
00:41:55,200 --> 00:41:56,560
- How is she?
- My Lord,

539
00:41:57,160 --> 00:41:59,760
the wound is deep and narrow.

540
00:42:00,320 --> 00:42:01,720
It may not heal easily.

541
00:42:01,800 --> 00:42:04,880
Once she's recovered a little,
the chief physician should examine her.

542
00:42:04,960 --> 00:42:07,360
No. We can't call the chief physician.

543
00:42:07,440 --> 00:42:09,360
It's just a small wound. I'll be fine.

544
00:42:10,000 --> 00:42:10,920
Just change the dressing every day.

545
00:42:11,600 --> 00:42:13,560
I'll do everything I can.

546
00:42:32,920 --> 00:42:34,240
Have a carriage prepared.

547
00:42:34,320 --> 00:42:36,400
At daybreak,
send Her Ladyship back to Zhuyu Estate.

548
00:42:37,240 --> 00:42:41,000
My Lord, Her Ladyship is injured.
She should stay here and recover.

549
00:42:42,400 --> 00:42:43,560
You're worrying for nothing.

550
00:42:44,080 --> 00:42:46,600
She clearly knows better.
She does whatever she wants.

551
00:42:47,320 --> 00:42:48,960
She doesn't care what you think.

552
00:42:49,600 --> 00:42:52,920
All your concern and worry
are completely wasted on her.

553
00:42:56,160 --> 00:42:57,000
Heartless woman.

554
00:43:04,720 --> 00:43:05,800
Let go.

555
00:43:15,360 --> 00:43:16,200
I said, let go.

556
00:43:17,960 --> 00:43:18,800
Lu Zhuo.

557
00:43:24,160 --> 00:43:25,400
Don't you have anything to say?

558
00:43:26,640 --> 00:43:27,920
About the estate…

559
00:43:30,160 --> 00:43:31,760
Tell me! Where did you get the nerve

560
00:43:31,840 --> 00:43:33,360
to storm the Crown Prince's Residence
and rescue those people?

561
00:43:34,160 --> 00:43:35,400
And you hid it from me?

562
00:43:37,440 --> 00:43:38,880
Easy. That hurts.

563
00:43:40,040 --> 00:43:42,360
Well, I read in a military strategy book

564
00:43:42,440 --> 00:43:45,760
that success depends on secrecy… No, wait.

565
00:43:47,400 --> 00:43:48,840
Speed is everything in battle.

566
00:43:50,560 --> 00:43:51,520
I didn't want to keep it from you.

567
00:43:52,200 --> 00:43:55,160
But you have important responsibilities.
I couldn't drag you into this.

568
00:43:55,960 --> 00:43:58,560
I had to handle the dirty work myself.

569
00:44:00,160 --> 00:44:02,720
Can't you forgive me
just this once? Please?

570
00:44:04,920 --> 00:44:05,760
Will you change?

571
00:44:07,040 --> 00:44:07,880
No.

572
00:44:09,440 --> 00:44:11,080
But I can swear to you.

573
00:44:13,560 --> 00:44:15,320
This is the last time
I'll ever lie to you.

574
00:44:16,160 --> 00:44:18,400
- If I ever lie again, I'll…
- You'll what?

575
00:44:21,080 --> 00:44:22,560
Be reborn as a pig or a dog.

576
00:44:23,560 --> 00:44:24,520
I swear.

577
00:44:31,960 --> 00:44:33,120
Your wound hurts again?

578
00:44:37,000 --> 00:44:38,000
Are you still mad at me?

579
00:44:40,000 --> 00:44:41,560
The Crown Prince's Residence
is heavily guarded.

580
00:44:43,000 --> 00:44:44,400
If anything had gone wrong,

581
00:44:46,200 --> 00:44:47,320
can you really made it out alive?

582
00:44:51,480 --> 00:44:53,680
- Actually, I…
- You went in

583
00:44:55,240 --> 00:44:57,160
knowing you might never come back.

584
00:44:59,600 --> 00:45:00,440
Didn't you?

585
00:45:19,680 --> 00:45:21,280
You're nothing but a liar.

586
00:45:24,800 --> 00:45:26,120
I can't trust you anymore.

587
00:45:38,920 --> 00:45:39,920
Lu Zhuo.

588
00:45:44,200 --> 00:45:46,520
Your Ladyship,
Lord Lu sent me to look after you.

589
00:45:46,600 --> 00:45:49,080
Whatever you need, just let me know.

590
00:48:11,000 --> 00:48:13,680
‪NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‪IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
